[p]⚠️ The Weekly Patch is Live!
[/p][p]🆕 New Features: [/p][p]+ Added ability to move creatures, items, and players on vehicles through portals;[/p][p]+ Added a key item for crafting the hoverbike - the ANTIGRAVITY_MODULE. Drops from destroyed hoverbikes with a 25% chance;[/p][p]+ Added crystal turrets to floating island structures;[/p][p]+ Added new structures for floating islands and updated old ones;[/p][p]+ Added themed furniture for floating island structures. A total of 40 blocks (lanterns, containers, windows, doors, etc.);[/p][p]+ Generic loot has been added to all new containers on the Flying Islands (will be improved in later updates);[/p][p]+ Added titanium and halonite pipes (currently without functionality);[/p][p]+ Added ability to stall/turn off the hoverbike engine;[/p][p]+ Added control panel for hoverbike;[/p][p]+ Added a temporary recipe for the hoverbike;[/p][p]+ Added reverse crafting for CLAY_BALL;
[/p][p]♻️ Changes:[/p][p]~ The clouds at the level of the Floating Islands are slightly raised so that they no longer intersect with the islands themselves;[/p][p]~ Changed hoverbike damage sound to match its material;[/p][p]~ Updated block placement preview visuals with new 'hologram' shader;[/p][p]~ PINCONES can now be used as furnace fuel;[/p][p]~ Changed texture of POINTED_ICE;[/p][p]~ ANIMAL_FAT is now edible;
[/p][p]🐞 Bug Fixes:[/p][p]* Fixed an issue where a tamed Stridewing would die when the player moved too far away. This also resolves the problem of hoverbikes disappearing for the same reason;[/p][p]* Fixed a visual bug where a character seated on a vehicle remained seated after logging out;[/p][p]* Fixed a bug with misaligned TRAPDOOR-type blocks in the upper position;[/p][p]* Fixed issues with placing CLINGCLAP_MUSHROOM;[/p][p]* Fixed minor texture errors in various models;[/p]

[p]⚠️ The Weekly Patch is Live!
[/p][p]🆕 New Features: [/p][p]+ A new type of transport has been added in test mode: the Hoverbike. Fast, maneuverable, and equipped with built-in storage (can only be obtained in Creative mode);[/p][p]+ Added 3 visual variants of Hoverbike to the Creative menu;[/p][p]+ Added the Destroyed Hoverbike block - you can get a lot of useful loot when destroying it and from its internal storage;[/p][p]+ Added a setting for camera roll while driving the Hoverbike to the settings menu;[/p][p]+ Added ability to see your character body while driving in 1st person mode(only on Hoverbike);[/p][p]+ Added ability for mobs to attack other mobs;[/p][p]+ Added 'Sit' option to Stridewing's interaction menu to replace RMB action;[/p][p]+ Destroyed Hoverbike block added to some structures;[/p][p]+ New flowing water sounds. Now any water surface makes sound, not just flowing water;
[/p][p]♻️ Changes:[/p][p]~ The interaction system between the pilot/rider models and the vehicle they control has been redesigned. This will eliminate many animation synchronization issues while driving;[/p][p]~ The domes of defense beacons now fade smoothly depending on the current rendering distance;[/p][p]~ Increased accuracy of melee hit detection with lag compensation;[/p][p]~ Footstep sounds now more accurately reflect the block the player is standing on;[/p][p]~ Monsters no longer try to swim when standing on FARMLAND or similar blocks near water;[/p][p]~ The Soulhound now can hunt small animals if hungry and bigger ones if very hungry;[/p][p]~ After a successful hunt, the Soulhound will first eat its prey and then start hunting again if it is not full;[/p][p]~ Bones and Cookies restore less hunger for the Soulhound than meat;[/p][p]~ Removed bulrush and cattail in cold biomes;
[/p][p]🐞 Bug Fixes:[/p][p]* Fixed tab switching with gamepads;[/p][p]* Fixed the inability to dismount from vehicles using game controllers. It can now be done with the Square button (PS) or X button (XBox);[/p][p]* Fixed errors when attempting actions with a missing block;[/p][p]* Fixed short loud water or lava sound at start of playback;[/p][p]* Fixed error when quickly Shift-clicking items in a dropped backpack;[/p]

[p]⚠️ The Weekly Patch is Live!
[/p][p]🆕 New Features: [/p][p]+ Added a new Metalwork Station. Most metal block recipes have been moved to it;[/p][p]+ Added various non-metalworking recipes (PORTAL, FLASH_DRIVE, MEDKIT_SMALL, MEDKIT_LARGE);[/p][p]+ Added recipes for most previously missing iron and scrap metal blocks;[/p][p]+ Added a new metal production material type - _ROD;[/p][p]+ Added the ability to change rotor speed and rotation direction via the context menu, as well as support for rotor operation inside a structure made of another rotor’s blocks;[/p][p]+ Added a flexible gender distribution system for mobs; some mobs will now have a predefined gender;[/p][p]+ Added a female version of Blueboo, 20% cuter;[/p][p]+ Added 3 new sign types: SCRAP_METAL_SIGN, IRON_SIGN, HOLO_SIGN;[/p][p]+ Added an interaction menu for collecting eggs from CHICKEN_NEST;[/p][p]+ Added _SLOPE and _SLAB variants for REINFORCED_CONCRETE;[/p][p]+ Added an animated loading indicator when the game starts;
[/p][p]♻️ Changes:[/p][p]~ Numerous changes to existing metal recipes. Most notable:[/p][p]SCRAP_METAL_PANELS now require 4x fewer materials and have been moved to the Metalwork Station;[/p][p]FASTENERS can now be made from iron and are used more widely;[/p][p]~ Some similar blocks now share identical recipes for simplicity (e.g., kitchen sets, metal roofings);[/p][p]~ A complete refactoring of the ticker system for cultivated plants and farmland has been carried out, improving code structure and optimizing performance;[/p][p]~ Updated the city1 generator with a redesign and additional details;[/p][p]~ Campfires can now be extinguished or relit via the interaction menu. Extinguished campfires no longer damage players or mobs;[/p][p]~ WOODEN_CABINET is now a container;[/p][p]~ Skewers can now be cooked in the STOVE;
[/p][p]🐞 Bug Fixes:[/p][p]* Fixed: minor UI rendering optimizations via the PixiJS library;[/p][p]* Fixed: skipping night now uses "set skytime 7000" instead of "set time 7000", because night duration was made shorter than day duration a few months ago. By default, players now wake up at 5:30 AM;[/p][p]* Fixed incorrect naming of GRASS_TUFT in the English localization;[/p][p]* Fixed tab switching in windows when using console game controllers;[/p]

[p]⚠️ The Weekly Patch is Live!
[/p][p]🆕 New Features: [/p][p]+ Added support for translating block names and descriptions into multiple languages;[/p][p]+ Added typewriter effect for dialogues, simulating text being typed on screen. The effect can be customized or disabled in settings;[/p][p]+ Added reflections of the sun and moon on the water surface;[/p][p]+ Added a new system that allows assigning sound effects to different block states;[/p][p]+ Added a new portal rendering shader;[/p][p]+ Added visual effects to the initial spawn structures;[/p][p]+ Added RUSTY_PORTAL block for spawn structure replacements;[/p][p]+ Added visual effects to STONE_FURNACE and ELECTRIC_FURNACE when active;[/p][p]+ Added new sounds for the stone furnace: opening/closing, smelting in progress, and smelting completion for each item in the queue;[/p][p]+ Added the ability to stack slabs downward when placed in the upper position;[/p][p]+ Added short-circuit and spark sounds for the broken portal;[/p][p]+ Added new pickaxe/axe mining animations, as well as animations for using a medkit;[/p][p]+ Added a sound effect for drinking beverages;[/p][p]+ Added new sounds for Blueboo;
[/p][p]♻️ Changes:[/p][p]~ Reworked internal sound playback system to eliminate clicking noises;[/p][p]~ Various mushrooms now count toward "Obtain some raw food" quest;[/p][p]~ Adjusted crafting times for PRIMITIVE_HATCHET, TORCH, WORKBENCH;[/p][p]~ Replaced the placement sounds for IRON and COPPER blocks with more appropriate ones;[/p][p]~ Block names and descriptions translated into Russian;[/p][p]~ Adjusted the volume of certain sound effects;[/p][p]~ Made various minor UI fixes;[/p][p]~ Slightly modified the portal model;
[/p][p]🐞 Bug Fixes:[/p][p]* Fixed a bug where earth half-slabs placed in the upper half of a block would sink down after being used to create paths with a shovel;[/p][p]* Fixed a bug where mobs remained highlighted when UI was hidden;[/p][p]* Fixed a bug where cows would jump while in water;[/p][p]* Fixed a bug that prevented players from sitting on diagonally rotated chairs;[/p][p]* Fixed the position of torchlight in hand in third-person view;[/p][p]* Fixed an issue where stacking blocks would destroy adjacent ones;[/p][p]* Fixed missing IRON_ORE in mountains;[/p][p]* Fixed numerous stone blocks not dropping when mined with PRIMITIVE_HATCHET;[/p][p]* Fixed frequency spikes in various sound effects;[/p]

[p]⚠️ The Weekly Patch is Live!
[/p][p]🆕 New Features: [/p][p]+ Added the ability to choose a spawn point with different structure options when creating a world;[/p][p]+ Added 4 new structures for the player's initial spawn;[/p][p]+ Added block preview before placement. It’s disabled by default but can be enabled in the “Interface” settings;[/p][p]+ Added background icons for player equipment slots;[/p][p]+ Sky improvements: smoother gradient between sun and moon during sunrise and sunset; the moon is now white;[/p][p]+ Night sky improvements: sky, fog, and clouds are now darker at night;
[/p][p]♻️ Changes:[/p][p]~ Temporarily disabled attacking with the PRIMITIVE HATCHET and all PICKAXE-type tools;[/p][p]~ Renamed PRIMITIVE AXE to PRIMITIVE HATCHET to reduce confusion;[/p][p]~ Slightly adjusted textures of some rusty blocks for better consistency with themed assets;[/p][p]~ Minor adjustments to the main questline;[/p][p]~ MESHROOM now drops small logs;
[/p][p]🐞 Bug Fixes:[/p][p]* Fixed conflicts between gamepad and keyboard/mouse controls;[/p][p]* Fixed hitbox for wall-mounted banners;[/p][p]* Fixed slow break speed for various WOODEN_FRAME shapes (stairs, slabs, slopes);[/p][p]* Fixed issue preventing interaction with the RUSTY_IRON_DOOR;[/p][p]* Fixed mobs floating in the air after loading;[/p][p]* Fixed JUKEBOX not turning off when its button is pressed repeatedly;[/p][p]* Fixed item deletion issues in creative inventory;[/p][p]* Fixed non-functional FARMLAND block variants in some structures;[/p][p]* Fixed UV mapping issues on all variants of the BIOCHAMBER block;[/p]

[p]🔥  Hotfix (alpha 0.0.6239)
[/p][p]♻️ Changes:[/p][p]~ Reduced inventory desyncs during fabrication caused by lags;[/p][p]~ Previously selected recipe is no longer cleared when switching from creative to regular inventory;
[/p][p]🐞 Bug Fixes:[/p][p]* Fixed server error during world structure generation;[/p][p]* Fixed error when a monster disappears while the camera is aimed at it;[/p][p]* Fixed server errors when its trying to grow DARK_OAK sapling;[/p][p]* Fixed quest state saving when structure generation fails;[/p][p]* Fixed crash when looking at multiblock with interactable shelves;[/p][p]* Fixed crash when taking things from dropped backpack;[/p][p]* Fixed a game loop crash when attempting to break a block within another player's beacon protection zone;[/p]

[p]⚠️ The Weekly Patch is Live!
[/p][p]🆕 New Features: [/p][p]+ Added context menu system for blocks and mobs based on their state;[/p][p]+ Added experimental stealth kill for sleeping Endoskeleton/Hollow (player must be sneaking with sword);[/p][p]+ Added distinct hit sounds based on weapon type, material, and target mob;[/p][p]+ Added “Invert Mouse Y” option;[/p][p]+ Added additional variants of rusted lab equipment and furniture:[/p][p](MESH_FLOORING, RUSTY_BENCH, RUSTY_BIG_DINING_TABLE, RUSTY_FRAMED_BIG_DINING_TABLE, RUSTY_DARK_FRAMED_BIG_DINING_TABLE, RUSTY_EXTINGUISHER, RUSTY_COOLING_UNIT, RUSTY_PURIFICATION_UNIT, RUSTY_COMMUNICATION_UNIT, BROKEN_RUSTY_COMMUNICATION_UNIT, RUSTY_STORAGE_RACK, RUSTY_RADAR, BROKEN_RUSTY_RADAR, RUSTY_SMALL_LAB_TANK, RUSTY_VENT_TRAPDOOR, RUSTY_BLAST_DOOR, JAMMED_RUSTY_BLAST_DOOR);[/p][p]+ Added secret interaction with Cluckfluff;[/p][p]+ Added crafting recipe for GLASS_BOTTLE (required for milking cows);[/p][p]+ Added emission for CAVEGRASS;
[/p][p]♻️ Changes:[/p][p]~ All mob interactions (feed, shear, milk...) now use a new context menu system. Clearly shows when feeding is possible (if holding food and mob is hungry);[/p][p]~ Replaced generic "Press E" prompt with context-specific actions (Open, Take, Sit, Lie Down etc.). Most blocks now show correct interaction;[/p][p]~ When holding food but mob isn't hungry, appropriate tooltip now appears;[/p][p]~ Cows can be milked with GLASS_BOTTLE. Shows a message if too hungry. Small chance to drop STABILIZER;[/p][p]~ Cows now use standard hunger system like other animals;[/p][p]~ Multiple crafting recipes with the same ingredients are supported. They can be viewed and selected in the crafting window;[/p][p]~ All production blocks now have different speed (higher level = faster);[/p][p]~ Reduced size of some chest-type windows;[/p][p]~ Reduced camera tilt intensity when player takes damage;[/p][p]~ Increased hunger restoration and saturation of HONEY;[/p][p]~ Changed names and visuals for metal stairs to better follow the overall style;[/p][p]~ Updated METAL_STRUCTURAL_FRAME texture to better match similar blocks;[/p][p]~ Redesigned world information window;[/p][p]~ Changed speed effect icon;[/p][p]~ GLASS_BOTTLE no longer classified as food;[/p][p]~ Minor visual bug fixes for various blocks;[/p][p]~ Updated open window sounds for certain blocks;
[/p][p]🐞 Bug Fixes:[/p][p]* Fixed animation bug where Stridewing remained in standing pose if mounted during sleep;[/p][p]* Fixed physics bugs related to jumping in water, stepping onto shore, and climbing blocks;[/p][p]* Fixed blockInfo occasionally not showing when hovering over blocks in inventory;[/p][p]* Fixed bug related to recipes that sometimes occurred at the start of the game;[/p][p]* Fixed text disappearing above hotbar and improved shadow rendering;[/p][p]* Fixed composter sometimes not working when too many items were inserted;[/p][p]* Fixed non-working anvil;[/p][p]* Fixed renaming of item stacks on the anvil;[/p][p]* Fixed emote menu sometimes not working;[/p][p]* Fixed JUKEBOX async loading bug: player now works on first disk insert;[/p][p]* Fixed crosshair not clearing from blocks when aiming at mobs;[/p][p]* Fixed inability to use carpenter's table recipes on fabricator;[/p][p]* Fixed inability to build upon certain stair types;[/p][p]* Fixed crash when placing HOPPER on shelves;[/p][p]* Fixed lid animation of non-working composter;[/p][p]* Fixed inability to use CHICKEN_NEST and CAKE;[/p][p]* Fixed collision boxes for CAVEGRASS and CAVE_LICHEN_CEILING;[/p][p]* Fixed overlapping of various UI elements with the chat;[/p][p]* Fixed placement issues with BROKEN_METALWORK_STATION;[/p]

[p]⚠️ The Weekly Patch is Live! (alpha 0.0.6203)
[/p][p]🆕 New Features: [/p][p]+ Icebergs now have ice slabs at water level, destroying them no longer removes the water;[/p][p]+ Added recipes for colored beds;
[/p][p]♻️ Changes:[/p][p]~ You can now close the inventory by pressing TAB again;[/p][p]~ Windows that are opened by pressing the "E" action key now can be closed with the same key (this key is remappable);[/p][p]~ Items dropped by other players can be picked up with an opened inventory window. Items that are dropped by you can be picked up only after a short delay, after closing inventory window;[/p][p]~ Mobs now break ENERGY_CRYSTALS just like players do if they step on them;[/p][p]~ A sound is now played and destruction particles appear when ENERGY_CRYSTALS are destroyed if stepped on (by both player and mobs);[/p][p]~ Mobs now take damage from dangerous blocks such as BARBED_WIRE or ENERGY_CRYSTALS;[/p][p]~ Hollow and Endoskeleton now forcibly burrow when energy reaches zero;[/p][p]~ Hollow and Endoskeleton no longer run in place when hit during sleep without valid target (creative mode, not visible player, turret...);[/p][p]~ Being hit during sleep restores some energy for Hollow/Endoskeleton to prevent immediate re-burrowing;[/p][p]~ Insufficient fuel in the furnace is indicated by blinking fuel icon;[/p][p]~ The browser bar of the web version displays a link to the current world so you can share it more easily;[/p][p]~ Mine will not activate if it does not ‘see’ a player or a mob;[/p][p]~ When a fabricator with opened window is destroyed - window is closed too;[/p][p]~ Cloud render distance reduced to 2500 blocks to make it easier to distinguish between distant and nearby clouds;[/p][p]~ Fuel icon now returns to empty fuel slots for clarity;[/p][p]~ Removed legacy shulker from flying island tower (replaced with a poor soul's camp);[/p][p]~ Disabled lava immersion effect when entering deactivated teleporters;
[/p][p]🐞 Bug Fixes:[/p][p]* Fixed landmines half-sphere trigger;[/p][p]* Fixed the radius of detection of players and mobs by the landmine;[/p][p]* Fixed stabilizer appearing in regular inventory slots, instead of special slot;[/p][p]* Fixed AABB collision box size for BLUE_ENERGY_CRYSTAL_FORMATION;[/p][p]* Fixed z-fighting on JERSEY_BARRIER and WOODEN_TRAINING_SWORD;[/p][p]* Fixed a bug that caused weapons to lose durability when swinging in the air, even if nothing was hit;[/p][p]* Fixed mobile device detection: PC with pens or sensor input were considered mobile devices, keyboard and mouse inputs were messed up;[/p][p]* Fixed coordinates desync when dismounting from a mob;[/p][p]* Fixed raft rotation animation;[/p][p]* Fixed world generator instability, removed extra dirt blocks in caves;[/p][p]* Fixed incorrect player state caused by being teleported while dead;[/p][p]* Fixed: when ingredients were missing, the displayed production time didn’t account for fabricator speed;[/p]

[p]⚠️ The Weekly Patch is Live!
[/p][p]🆕 New Features: [/p][p]+ Added recipes that allow using less ore but require STABILIZER;[/p][p]+ Added STABILIZER as possible tasks reward;[/p][p]+ Added ability to spend STABILIZER in recipes;[/p][p]+ Added recipe to convert SCRAP_IRON_INGOT to IRON_INGOT using STABILIZER;[/p][p]+ Added a setting to disable auto-jump;[/p][p]+ STABILIZER added as ingredient for high-tier recipes (for example FABRICATOR);
[/p][p]♻️ Changes:[/p][p]~ Clouds are now more affected by sky color (distant clouds blend smoother with horizon);[/p][p]~ Trees consisting of thin and medium trunks are now cut down 2x and 1.5x faster respectively;[/p][p]~ Item held by the mouse is considered when determining if the recipe can be crafted;[/p][p]~ The production time of an item is now always shown, not only when the required ingredients were available;[/p][p]~ Recipes that use STABILIZER are marked with a small icon;[/p][p]~ All mobs now drop STABILIZER (higher chance from dangerous ones);[/p][p]~ STABILIZER can drop from rock blocks, ores, grass, trees (the list will expand and the chances will be adjusted);[/p][p]~ STABILIZER added to some structures;[/p][p]~ STABILIZER can appear in various containers;[/p][p]~ STABILIZER added as reward for completing some main quest stages;[/p][p]~ Destroying MOB_SPAWNER now drops random amount of STABILIZER;[/p][p]~ Soulhound can sometimes dig up STABILIZER instead of bones;[/p][p]~ Chance to get STABILIZER from harvesting fully grown crops;[/p][p]~ Small chance to catch STABILIZER while fishing;[/p][p]~ Small chance to get STABILIZER when shearing Sheep;[/p][p]~ Players lose 10% of STABILIZER on death;[/p][p]~ Improved block leak protection for some structures during worldgen;[/p][p]~ Most dance names changed to more neutral ones;
[/p][p]🐞 Bug Fixes:[/p][p]* Fixed raft movement animation when the Shift key is pressed;[/p][p]* Fixed recipe list update when switching from creative inventory and when deleting items;[/p][p]* Fixed visual issues with ADVANCED_FABRICATOR model;
[/p][p]💡 Tip: STABILIZER is a special universal element in the world of Tesera. It can influence the structure of various matter, suppress unstable phenomena, and even serves as a form of local currency. Whether you’re crafting, trading, or exploring - keep some on hand![/p]

⚠️ The Weekly Patch is Live!

🆕 New Features: 
+ Added new Hauler Bot mob;
+ Added Hauler Bot spawns in mines and some structures;
+ Added Close button in Steam client;
+ Added the ability to possess the entity you're looking at by pressing the ALT + RMB key combination (creative mode only);
+ Added new dance: Bait-n-Switch;
+ Added teleportation effect when Stalker Drone appears;
+ Added new idle animations for Redhorn, Blueboo, and Sheep;
+ Added alternate death animations for Cluckfluff, Blueboo, Redhorn, Fennec, Sheep, Soulhound, Stridewing, and all Teseranid variants;
+ Implemented reverse-depth shader technique; clouds are rendered at a huge distance (3000 blocks);

♻️ Changes:
~ Stridewing now plays a separate saddle equipping animation instead of the feeding animation;
~ Improved the physical stabilization of entities on the surface of water;
~ Stridewing does not flap its wings when slightly rising above water;
~ Reduced Fennec's movement speed;
~ Removed Netherrack (legacy block) from shelves in one structure;

🐞 Bug Fixes:
* Fixed inability to sit on a raft;
* Fixed a bug in the emote wheel that prevented emotes from playing;
* Fixed a bug with rendering clothes through the player's transparency on obstacles;
* Fixed fluid visual updates;
* Fixed overlapping fluids (especially lava) drawing through blocks, thanks to reverse-depth technique in shader;
* Fixed rendering issues with some decals;
* Fixed missing multiblock property for BROKEN_ADVANCED_FABRICATOR and BROKEN_METALWORK_STATION;
* Fixed bug causing Cluckfluff and Fennec to play running animation instead of swimming;
* Fixed bug causing Cluckfluff's swimming speed to become too slow;
* Fixed bug preventing Hermit Crab from going to the bottom (stayed on surface);
* Fixed bug where bottom-walking mobs didn't play movement animations;
* Texture fixes for Redhorn and Sheep to accommodate new animations;
* Various minor texture fixes;

⚠️ The Minor Patch is Live!

🆕 New Features:
+ Added smooth and pleasant auto-jumping for the character; 
+ Added new blocks: BROKEN_WORKBENCH, BROKEN_FABRICATOR, BROKEN_ADVANCED_FABRICATOR, BROKEN_ELECTRIC_FURNACE, BROKEN_METALWORK_STATION, RUSTY_METAL_LADDER, RUSTY_IRON_BARS, RUSTY_IRON_DOOR, RUSTY_IRON_TRAPDOOR;
+ Added component drops from broken workbenches;
+ Added new workbench recipes:

Glass panes of all colors;,
Glass blocks from panes of all colors;,
Colored glass blocks (smelted in furnace);,
WOODEN_SHAFT from a large log;,
Changed GLASS recipe;,
Changed WOODPILE block recipe;,

♻️ Changes:
~ Reduced memory usage on server and single-player mode - removed data duplicated on both worker and main threads;
~ Changed default value of video-memory for geometry: its 380 megabytes instead of 130, allows to bypass certain lag-spikes in the beginning of the game;
~ Character movement up and down stairs is now smoother;
~ Changed drop behavior for VOIDCUP — breaks into a block by hand, drops grass when hit with a sword;
~ Changed texture and placement height of LILLY_PAD;
~ Only plants can now be placed in flower pots;
~ CLAY_VESSEL now drops broken parts when destroyed with a pickaxe/axe, whole block when broken by hand;
~ VOIDCUP added to mushroom/mixed skewer recipe;
~ Removed legacy tags: IRON_BLOCK, MUSHROOM_STEW, FLINT_AND_STEEL;
~ Removed impossible stone drop from IRON_TRAPDOOR;
~ Updated texture of ELECTRIC_FURNACE;
~ Improved shoreline generator near canyons(now smooth instead of steep walls);

🐞 Bug Fixes:
* Fixed lag spikes in graphics and sound: some operations are moved to worker thread: for example, rendering of fluids;
* Fixed issue where upgrading DEFENSE_BEACON failed;
* Fixed UI behavior for terminals and portal;
* Fixed tooltip display in inventory, equipment windows, and containers;
* Fixed number display on REPEATER block;
* Fixed visual bug on leather backpacks;
* Fixed issue where CAVE_LICHEN_CEILING would not attach to ceilings;
* Fixed issue where CLINGCLAP_MUSHROOMS couldn’t be placed on walls and didn’t rotate randomly on the floor;
* Fixed bug that prevented cake from being broken;
* Fixed missing lighting on REDSTONE_LAMP with ULTRA graphics settings;
* Fixed texture of RUSTY_SINGLE_TILE_METAL_PANELING_SLOPE;
* Fixed inventory update errors when removing items;
* Fixed materials on MESH_GATE;
* Fixed player sliding on the CROSSBOW_TURRET block;

⚠️ The Weekly Patch is Live!

🆕 New Features: 
+ Added new mobs: Hermit Crab, Vac Drone, Teseranid Shepard;
+ Added Teseranid Shepard and two Hermit Crab color variants to world generation;
+ Added Vac Drone spawns to some high-tech structures;
+ Added new hunger mechanism for the following mobs: Soulhound, Blueboo, Sheep, Stridewing, Cluckfluff;
+ At low hunger levels, mobs pick up food items to restore hunger and health (each mob has its own food list);
+ Soulhound now digs up a bone if no other food is found (50% chance);
+ Sheep can now regrow wool by eating grass (20% chance from ground, 33% from nearby thrown items);
+ Peaceful mobs now follow players holding or standing near their preferred food (only if hungry);
+ Mobs only eat food when reaching specific hunger thresholds;
+ Hermit Crab hides under rocks when spotting players (becomes invulnerable, but can be scared with pickaxe hits);
+ Hermit Crab has a small chance to drop random ore chunks;
+ Vac Drone vacuums nearby items (10-slot limit, drops all on death, oldest deleted when full);
+ Added a new item STRIDEWING_SADDLE with a crafting recipe. Used to ride Stridewing;
+ STRIDEWING_SADDLE can be applied directly to Stridewing;
+ Attempting to ride Stridewing without a saddle causes panic — it will run uncontrollably until the rider is thrown off;

♻️ Changes:
~ All mobs now use new smooth-shading rendering;
~ Added dynamic stat modification for mobs in specific states;
~ Added physics to mobs — they now recognize each other as obstacles and avoid clustering;
~ Mobs can now move to and collect desired items;
~ Aggressive mobs no longer run endlessly when unable to reach a player;
~ Lost targets trigger a "give up" animation before returning to normal;
~ Unreachable but visible targets activate tracking mode with occasional animations;
~ Improved mob obstacle detection (reduces clipping into blocks);
~ Adjusted attack ranges for several mobs;
~ Increased max random turn angle for mobs before movement (less predictable paths);
~ Mobs no longer take damage from the player who mounts them;
~ Increased the height threshold for fall damage when riding mobs;
~ Stackable blocks can now be placed by clicking base, rear block, or side;
~ Sheep health increased to 20;

🐞 Bug Fixes:
* Snowballs could hit entities beside their flight path;
* Fixed placement of stackable blocks (e.g. lockers);
* Fixed quiet sound when placing stackable blocks;
* Fixed black text color on item count when dragging;
* Fixed issue in Sheep texture;

⚠️ The Weekly Patch is Live!

🆕 New Features: 
+ Added attack animations for Stridewing;
+ Added a basic hunger mechanic for Stridewing and Teseranid;
+ Added a scattering dirt effect to Soulhound's digging animations;
+ Fennec now has the ability to close its eyes for blinking and death/sleep animations;

♻️ Changes:
~ Chairs and some other objects no longer break from weapon swings;
~ The texture of the green Fennec has been slightly toned down;
~ Animals now shake off water when exiting it;
~ Significantly improved the issue of animals walking on water;
~ Soulhound now attempts to chase the player in water;
~ Soulhound no longer decides to suddenly nap when night falls if it was chasing the player;
~ Soulhound's eyes no longer glow when it is sleeping;
~ Stridewing and Teseranid can now passively restore health after feeding from the ground or sleeping;
~ Stridewing now reacts to player attacks. If the damage is not caused by a weapon and its health is high, it will respond with a single strike. If the damage is caused by a weapon or its health is moderate, it will attack for a short time. If its health is low, it will start panicking;
~ Teseranid will now burrow (despawn) when its hunger level is low;
~ Reduced Teseranid's running speed and increased the speed of its corresponding animation;
~ Reduced the ratio of idle actions to movement for Endoskeleton (moves more frequently);

🐞 Bug Fixes:
* Fixed the excessive number of snowdrift houses in snowy biomes;
* Fixed the absence of CRAFTING_TABLE in the legacy block list;
* Fixed the lack of oxygen consumption underwater;
* Fixed errors when accessing adjacent blocks on the server;
* Fixed the broken sword swing animation;
